, "end": 13.44, "text": " Et je vous déniche les pépites à Toulouse.", "words": [{"w": " Et", "s": 11.68, "e": 11.8}, {"w": " je", "s": 11.8, "e": 11.92}, {"w": " vous", "s": 11.92, "e": 12.04}, {"w": " déniche", "s": 12.04, "e": 12.38}, {"w": " les", "s": 12.38, "e": 12.58}, {"w": " pépites", "s": 12.58, "e": 12.96}, {"w": " à", "s": 12.96, "e": 13.2}, {"w": " Toulouse.", "s": 13.2, "e": 13.44}]}, {"start": 13.52, "end": 16.94, "text": " On se retrouve chez Bebs Chai, à deux pas du métro des skiroles et des carmes.", "words": [{"w": " On", "s": 13.52, "e": 13.6}, {"w": " se", "s": 13.6, "e": 13.78}, {"w": " retrouve", "s": 13.78, "e": 14.04}, {"w": " chez", "s": 14.04, "e": 14.26}, {"w": " Bebs", "s": 14.26, "e": 14.6}, {"w": " Chai,", "s": 14.6, "e": 14.78}, {"w": " à", "s": 14.9, "e": 15.04}, {"w": " deux", "s": 15.04, "e": 15.16}, {"w": " pas", "s": 15.16, "e": 15.3}, {"w": " du", "s": 15.3, "e": 15.42}, {"w": " métro", "s": 15.42, "e": 15.78}, {"w": " des", "s": 15.78, "e": 15.96}, {"w": " skiroles", "s": 15.96, "e": 16.4}, {"w": " et", "s": 16.4, "e": 16.52}, {"w": " des", "s": 16.52, "e": 16.76}, {"w": " carmes.", "s": 16.76, "e": 16.94}]}, {"start": 17.04, "end": 19.62, "text": " Ici, tout est végétarien, bien gourmand et délicieux.", "words": [{"w": " Ici,", "s": 17.04, "e": 17.36}, {"w": " tout", "s": 17.46, "e": 17.54}, {"w": " est", "s": 17.54, "e": 17.68}, {"w": " végétarien,", "s": 17.68, "e": 18.22}, {"w": " bien", "s": 18.34, "e": 18.52}, {"w": " gourmand", "s": 18.52, "e": 18.86}, {"w": " et", "s": 18.86, "e": 19.16}, {"w": " délicieux.", "s": 19.16, "e": 19.62}]}, {"start": 19.66, "end": 22.72, "text": " On démarre avec Greg, qui tient une célèbre page Consciences Echos.", "words": [{"w": " On", "s": 19.66, "e": 19.84}, {"w": " démarre", "s": 19.84, "e": 20.16}, {"w": " avec", "s": 20.16, "e": 20.4}, {"w": " Greg,", "s": 20.4, "e": 20.74}, {"w": " qui", "s": 20.82, "e": 21.02}, {"w": " tient", "s": 21.02, "e": 21.14}, {"w": " une", "s": 21.14, "e":