}, {"w": "'était", "s": 29.74, "e": 29.74}, {"w": " bien", "s": 29.74, "e": 29.92}, {"w": " assaisonné,", "s": 29.92, "e": 30.28}]}, {"start": 30.34, "end": 31.04, "text": " j'y retournerais avec plaisir.", "words": [{"w": " j", "s": 30.34, "e": 30.44}, {"w": "'y", "s": 30.44, "e": 30.52}, {"w": " retournerais", "s": 30.52, "e": 30.78}, {"w": " avec", "s": 30.78, "e": 30.92}, {"w": " plaisir.", "s": 30.92, "e": 31.04}]}, {"start": 31.22, "end": 33.9, "text": " Ensuite, on enchaîne avec Andrea, qui a failli se faire écraser.", "words": [{"w": " Ensuite,", "s": 31.22, "e": 31.4}, {"w": " on", "s": 31.64, "e": 31.76}, {"w": " enchaîne", "s": 31.76, "e": 31.92}, {"w": " avec", "s": 31.92, "e": 32.16}, {"w": " Andrea,", "s": 32.16, "e": 32.52}, {"w": " qui", "s": 32.6, "e": 32.7}, {"w": " a", "s": 32.7, "e": 32.88}, {"w": " failli", "s": 32.88, "e": 33.0}, {"w": " se", "s": 33.0, "e": 33.22}, {"w": " faire", "s": 33.22, "e": 33.5}, {"w": " écraser.", "s": 33.5, "e": 33.9}]}, {"start": 34.3, "end": 35.6, "text": " Coucou, ça fait longtemps ?", "words": [{"w": " Coucou,", "s": 34.3, "e": 34.58}, {"w": " ça", "s": 34.78, "e": 34.94}, {"w": " fait", "s": 34.94, "e": 35.04}, {"w": " longtemps", "s": 35.04, "e": 35.34}, {"w": " ?", "s": 35.34, "e": 35.6}]}, {"start": 35.6, "end": 37.34, "text": " J'ai pris des boulettes, je ne sais plus le nom.", "words": [{"w": " J", "s": 35.6, "e": 35.7}, {"w": "'ai", "s": 35.7, "e": 35.78}, {"w": " pris", "s": 35.78, "e": 35.94}, {"w": " des", "s": 35.94, "e": 36.16}, {"w": " boulettes,", "s": 36.16, "e": 36.6}, {"w": " je", "s": 36.84, "e": 36.98}, {"w": " ne", "s": 36.98, "e": 37.12}, {"w": " sais", "s": 37.12, "e": 37.12}, {"w": " plus", "s": 37.12, "e": 37.24}, {"w": " le", "s": 37.24, "e": 37.32}, {"w": " nom.", "s": 37.32, "e": 37.34}]}, {"start": 37.4, "end": 40.52, "text": " Alors c'était du riz gluant, je vais me faire écraser, j'ai peur.", "words": [{"w": " Alors", "s": 37.4, "e": 37.58}, {"w": " c", "s": 37.58, "e": 37.74}, {"w": "'était", "s": 37.74, "e": 37.86}, {"w": " du", "s": 37.86, "e": 38.12}, {"w": " riz", "s": 38.12, "e": 38.76}, {"w": " gluant,", "s": 38.76, "e": 39.42}, {"w": " je", "s": 39.54, "e": 39.6}, {"w": " vais", "s": 39.6, "e": 39.66}, {"w": " me", "s": 39.66, "e": 39.72}, {"w": " faire", "s": 39.72, "e": 39.84}, {"w": " écraser,", "s": 39.84, "e": 40.18}, {"w": " j", "s": 40.24, "e": 40.32}, {"w": "'ai", "s": 40.32, "e": 40.32}, {"w": " peur.", "s": 40.32, "e": 40.52}]}, {"start": 40.6, "end": 44.28, "text": " Il y avait du riz gluant et oh là, je ne sais plus, je n'ai pas révisé.", "words": [{"w": " Il", "s": 40.6, "e": 40.72}, {"w": " y", "s": 40.72, "e": 40.76}, {"w": " avait", "s": 40.76, "e": 40.94}, {"w": " du", "s": 40.94, "e": 41.3}, {"w": " riz", "s": 41.3, "e": 41.88}, {"w": " gluant", "s": 41.88, "e": 42.32}, {"w": " et", "s": 42.32, "e": 42.66}, {"w": " oh", "s": 42.66, "e": 42.9}, {"w": " là,", "s": 42.9, "e": 43.04}, {"w": " je", "s": 43.06, "e": 43.16}, {"w": " ne", "s": 43.16, "e": 43.38}, {"w": " sais", "s": 43.38, "e": 43.38}, {"w": " plus,", "s": 43.38, "e": 43.5}, {"w": " je", "s": 43.52, "e": 43.58}, {"w": " n", "s": 43.58, "e": 43.64}, {"w": "'ai", "s": 43.64, "e": 43.64}, {"w": " pas", "s": 43.64, "e": 43.78}, {"w": " révisé.", "s": 43.78, "e": 44.28}]}, {"start": 44.34, "end": 45.22, "text": " Tu peux me dire ce qu'il y avait dedans ?", "words": [{"w": " Tu", "s": 44.34, "e": 44.4}, {"w": " peux", "s": 44.4, "e": 44.48}, {"w": " me", "s": 44.48, "e": 44.6}, {"w": " dire", "s": 44.6, "e": 44.68}, {"w": " ce", "s": 44.68, "e": 44.8}, {"w": " qu", "s": 44.8, "e": 44.86}, {"w": "'il", "s": 44.86, "e": 44.86}, {"w": " y", "s": 44.86, "e": 44.86}, {"w": " avait", "s": 44.86, "e": 44.94}, {"w": " dedans", "s": 44.94, "e": 45.08}, {"w": " ?", "s": 45.08, "e": 45.22}]}, {"start": 45.22, "end": 46.16, "text": " Non, tu te débrouilles en fait.", "words": [{"w": " Non,", "s": 45.22, "e": 45.32}, {"w": " tu", "s": 45.36, "e": 45.46}, {"w": " te", "s": 45.46,